{ TEXT("擴散衝擊波清除彈幕，對 Boss 造成一次大傷害"), TEXT("A spreading shockwave clears bullets and hits the boss hard once") },
{ TEXT("蒼"), TEXT("Sou") },
{ TEXT("貫穿型"), TEXT("Piercing Type") },
{ TEXT("雷弓光束持續貫穿"), TEXT("A thunder-bow beam that pierces continuously") },
