{ TEXT("敵方減速一半（不無敵）"), TEXT("Enemies move at half speed (not invincible)") },
{ TEXT("雪"), TEXT("Yuki") },
{ TEXT("操偶型"), TEXT("Puppet Type") },
{ TEXT("四體式神尾隨射擊"), TEXT("Four shikigami follow and shoot") },
{ TEXT("傀儡「式神暴雨」"), TEXT("Puppet \"Shikigami Storm\"") },
{ TEXT("式神扇形亂射"), TEXT("The shikigami spray shots in fans") },
{ TEXT("簡單"), TEXT("Easy") },
{ TEXT("彈幕稀疏、速度較慢，殘機多兩個"), TEXT("Sparse, slower bullets and two extra lives") },
