{ TEXT("密度更高，適合熟練的玩家"), TEXT("Denser patterns for practised players") },
{ TEXT("瘋狂"), TEXT("Lunatic") },
{ TEXT("全力的彈幕，非常人所能及"), TEXT("Full-power danmaku beyond mortal reach") },
{ TEXT("額外"), TEXT("Extra") },
{ TEXT("通關後的特別挑戰"), TEXT("A special challenge after clearing the game") },
{ TEXT("最終符卡：Bomb 傷害無效"), TEXT("Last card: bombs deal no damage") },
{ TEXT("警告"), TEXT("WARNING") },
{ TEXT("前方，就是天和閣"), TEXT("Ahead lies the Tenhou Pavilion") },
{ TEXT("符卡收取！！"), TEXT("Spell Card Captured!!") },
{ TEXT("收取失敗……"), TEXT("Capture Failed...") },
{ TEXT("靈符碎片"), TEXT("Bomb piece") },
{ TEXT("1UP！"), TEXT("1UP!") },
{ TEXT("殘機碎片"), TEXT("Life pieces") },
{ TEXT("靈符 +1"), TEXT("Bomb +1") },
{ TEXT("分數獎勵　1UP！"), TEXT("Score Bonus  1UP!") },
{ TEXT("擦彈獎勵"), TEXT("Graze bonus") },
{ TEXT("饕餮"), TEXT("Taotie") },
{ TEXT("貪食的凶獸"), TEXT("The Gluttonous Beast") },
{ TEXT("饕符「貪食之口」"), TEXT("Glutton Sign \"Devouring Maw\"") },
{ TEXT("饕符「鐘鼎饌宴」"), TEXT("Glutton Sign \"Banquet of Bronze Cauldrons\"") },
{ TEXT("饕符「饕餮紋」"), TEXT("Glutton Sign \"Taotie Motif\"") },
{ TEXT("嗯？好香的味道……是吃了五份力量的小鬼啊。"), TEXT("Hm? Something smells delicious... A brat who swallowed five powers.") },
{ TEXT("你是誰？天宮怎麼變成這樣了……燁呢？"), TEXT("Who are you? What happened to the Heavenly Palace... Where's Yoh?") },
{ TEXT("我是饕餮。結界碎了，那個守護者也睡著了。被壓在四神底下幾千年，終於能出來吃頓飽飯。"), TEXT("I am Taotie. The barrier broke, and that guardian fell asleep. Thousands of years under the Four Gods, and at last I can come out for a proper meal.") },
{ TEXT("我也好餓！可是你吃掉的是天宮耶！"), TEXT("I'm starving too! But you're eating the Heavenly Palace!") },
{ TEXT("天宮、雲、星星，什麼都能吃。上面還有我的兄弟們——檮杌、混沌、窮奇。勸你回頭，他們可沒我這麼好說話。"), TEXT("The palace, the clouds, the stars, I can eat anything. My brothers are further up: Taowu, Hundun and Qiongqi. Turn back. They aren't as friendly as me.") },
{ TEXT("才不要！說好要讓燁請大家吃飯的！"), TEXT("No way! Yoh promised to treat everyone to dinner!") },
{ TEXT("哈哈！那就比比看，誰的胃口比較大！"), TEXT("Haha! Then let's see whose appetite is bigger!") },
{ TEXT("檮杌"), TEXT("Taowu") },
{ TEXT("不馴的凶獸"), TEXT("The Untamable Beast") },
{ TEXT("杌符「頑石不化」"), TEXT("Stubborn Sign \"Stone That Never Yields\"") },
{ TEXT("杌符「難訓之獸」"), TEXT("Stubborn Sign \"Beast That Cannot Be Taught\"") },
{ TEXT("杌符「丈八之尾」"), TEXT("Stubborn Sign \"Tail of Eighteen Feet\"") },
{ TEXT("……射手。你也是來把我們壓回去的？"), TEXT("...Archer. Have you come to push us back under too?") },
{ TEXT("結界碎了。你是什麼。"), TEXT("The barrier is broken. What are you.") },
{ TEXT("檮杌。四神鎮壓的四凶之一。不聽教誨，不肯回頭——你們是這麼說我的吧。"), TEXT("Taowu. One of the Four Perils the Four Gods held down. Deaf to teaching, never turning back. That's what you people say of me, isn't it?") },
{ TEXT("我只問一件事：燁在哪。"), TEXT("One question. Where is Yoh.") },
{ TEXT("在上面睡著。和我的兄弟們在一起——饕餮、混沌、窮奇。去了，你會死。"), TEXT("Asleep up there, with my brothers: Taotie, Hundun and Qiongqi. Go, and you'll die.") },
{ TEXT("那就先過你。"), TEXT("Then I go through you first.") },
{ TEXT("好。我也從不退。"), TEXT("Good. I never retreat either.") },
{ TEXT("混沌"), TEXT("Hundun") },
{ TEXT("無面的凶獸"), TEXT("The Faceless Beast") },
{ TEXT("沌符「七竅未開」"), TEXT("Chaos Sign \"Seven Openings Not Yet Bored\"") },
{ TEXT("沌符「無面之舞」"), TEXT("Chaos Sign \"Dance Without a Face\"") },
{ TEXT("沌符「帝江歌舞」"), TEXT("Chaos Sign \"Song and Dance of Dijiang\"") },
{ TEXT("孩子們說，您沒有臉。可是您在笑。"), TEXT("The children say you have no face. But you're smiling.") },
{ TEXT("我是混沌。沒有眼睛，也看得見你。沒有耳朵，也聽得見結界碎掉的聲音。"), TEXT("I am Hundun. I have no eyes, yet I see you. I have no ears, yet I heard the barrier shatter.") },
{ TEXT("燁先生……在哪裡呢？"), TEXT("Mr. Yoh... where is he?") },
{ TEXT("他睡著了。四神倒下，我們四個便出來了。上面的兄弟們等著呢——饕餮、檮杌、窮奇。"), TEXT("Asleep. When the Four Gods fell, the four of us came out. My brothers wait above: Taotie, Taowu and Qiongqi.") },
{ TEXT("孩子們想帶燁先生回家。"), TEXT("The children want to take Mr. Yoh home.") },
{ TEXT("那就跳一支舞吧，人偶師。跳完了，若你還站著，就往上走。"), TEXT("Then dance with me, puppeteer. If you are still standing when the dance ends, go on up.") },
{ TEXT("窮奇"), TEXT("Qiongqi") },
{ TEXT("顛倒是非的凶獸"), TEXT("The Beast Who Turns Right and Wrong Upside Down") },
{ TEXT("奇符「懲善揚惡」"), TEXT("Winged Sign \"Punish the Good, Praise the Wicked\"") },
{ TEXT("奇符「翼虎狂風」"), TEXT("Winged Sign \"Gale of the Winged Tiger\"") },
{ TEXT("奇符「食人從首」"), TEXT("Winged Sign \"Devoured Head First\"") },
{ TEXT("喲，好正直的眼神。我最喜歡吃你這種人了。"), TEXT("Oh, such honest eyes. People like you are my favourite meal.") },
{ TEXT("你就是把天宮搞成這樣的傢伙？"), TEXT("You're the one who wrecked the Heavenly Palace?") },
{ TEXT("我是窮奇。結界碎了，四神睡了，我們四凶自由了。有人爭吵的時候，我專吃講理的那一邊。"), TEXT("I am Qiongqi. The barrier broke, the Four Gods sleep, and we Four Perils are free. When people quarrel, I always eat the one who's in the right.") },
{ TEXT("歪理！燁在哪裡！"), TEXT("That's twisted! Where's Yoh!") },
{ TEXT("在上面，和我的兄弟們一起——饕餮、檮杌、混沌。好心勸你一句：回頭吧，正直的人在上面活不久。"), TEXT("Up there, with my brothers: Taotie, Taowu and Hundun. A word of kindly advice: turn back. Honest people don't last long up there.") },
{ TEXT("我才不回頭！"), TEXT("I'm not turning back!") },
{ TEXT("哈！那就從頭開始，一口一口吃掉你！"), TEXT("Ha! Then I'll start from your head and eat you bite by bite!") },
{ TEXT("四凶"), TEXT("The Four Perils") },
{ TEXT("結界下的上古凶獸"), TEXT("Ancient Beasts Beneath the Barrier") },
{ TEXT("崩落天宮・四凶之淵"), TEXT("Fallen Heavenly Palace: Abyss of the Four Perils") },
{ TEXT("凶符「吞天噬地」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Swallowing Heaven and Earth\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「無底之胃」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Bottomless Stomach\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「傲狠明德」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Arrogant and Cruel\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「不退之陣」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Formation of No Retreat\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「混元一氣」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Primordial Breath\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「渾沌初開」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Chaos Splits Open\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「顛倒是非」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Right and Wrong Reversed\"") },
{ TEXT("凶符「窮奇之翼」"), TEXT("Peril Sign \"Wings of Qiongqi\"") },
{ TEXT("耐久「四凶降世」"), TEXT("Survival \"Four Perils Descend\"") },
{ TEXT("終符「四凶・天地失序」"), TEXT("Final Sign \"Four Perils: Heaven and Earth in Disorder\"") },
{ TEXT("來了來了！窮奇說的那個正直小鬼！"), TEXT("Here he comes! The honest brat Qiongqi told us about!") },
{ TEXT("……打倒了窮奇，還敢往上走。"), TEXT("...You beat Qiongqi and still dare to climb higher.") },
{ TEXT("你們就是四凶！把燁還來！"), TEXT("So you're the Four Perils! Give Yoh back!") },
{ TEXT("他就睡在我們身後。四神結界碎了，守護者也撐不住了。"), TEXT("He sleeps behind us. The Four Gods Barrier is broken, and the guardian couldn't hold on.") },
{ TEXT("我說過了吧？正直的人在上面活不久。"), TEXT("Didn't I tell you? Honest people don't last long up here.") },
{ TEXT("為什麼要出來搗亂！結界壓著你們，大家才能好好過日子！"), TEXT("Why come out and cause trouble! The barrier held you down so everyone could live in peace!") },
{ TEXT("我們被壓了幾千年。沒有人問過我們，想不想好好過日子。"), TEXT("We were held down for thousands of years. No one ever asked whether we wanted to live in peace.") },
{ TEXT("所以啊——你身上那五份力量，正好讓我們吃個飽！"), TEXT("So, those five powers inside you will make a fine feast for us!") },
{ TEXT("休想！我一個一個打回去！"), TEXT("Not a chance! I'll knock you back one by one!") },
{ TEXT("好啊，一個一個來。最後，四個一起！"), TEXT("Fine, one by one. And at the end, all four together!") },
{ TEXT("……你果然來了。"), TEXT("...So you came.") },
{ TEXT("燁在哪。"), TEXT("Where is Yoh.") },
{ TEXT("哇，好冷的人。檮杌，這就是打敗你的射手？"), TEXT("Wow, what a cold one. Taowu, is this the archer who beat you?") },
{ TEXT("眼神真直，我喜歡。"), TEXT("Such straight eyes. I like him.") },
{ TEXT("守護者在後面睡著。四神倒了，結界碎了。你要做什麼呢？"), TEXT("The guardian sleeps behind us. The Four Gods have fallen and the barrier is broken. What will you do?") },
{ TEXT("把你們射回原位。用我身上這五份力量。"), TEXT("Shoot you back where you belong. With the five powers inside me.") },
{ TEXT("我們不會退。你也不會。那就只剩一條路。"), TEXT("We won't retreat. Neither will you. Then only one road is left.") },
{ TEXT("我只需要四箭。"), TEXT("I only need four arrows.") },
{ TEXT("哈哈哈！四箭？那就讓你一箭一箭試試！"), TEXT("Hahaha! Four arrows? Then try them, one at a time!") },
{ TEXT("又是你！剛剛還沒吃夠嗎？"), TEXT("You again! Didn't you get enough just now?") },
{ TEXT("還沒！而且燁欠我一頓飯！"), TEXT("Not yet! And Yoh owes me a meal!") },
{ TEXT("這山伏是怎麼回事？一點都不怕。"), TEXT("What's with this mountain monk? He's not scared at all.") },
{ TEXT("他心裡沒有恐懼。只有……肚子餓。"), TEXT("There is no fear in his heart. Only... hunger.") },
{ TEXT("哼。結界碎了，守護者睡了，我們出來了。你一個人能做什麼？"), TEXT("Hmph. The barrier broke, the guardian sleeps, and we are free. What can you do alone?") },
{ TEXT("把你們打回去，然後叫醒燁，大家一起吃飯！你們也可以來喔！"), TEXT("Knock you all back, wake Yoh up, and then everyone eats together! You can come too!") },
{ TEXT("……這、這是在邀請我們？"), TEXT("...A-are you inviting us?") },
{ TEXT("先打贏再說吧，小鬼！"), TEXT("Win first, brat!") },
{ TEXT("人偶師。你跳完舞了，還站著。"), TEXT("Puppeteer. You finished the dance, and you are still standing.") },
{ TEXT("是的……孩子們都在。"), TEXT("Yes... the children are all here.") },
{ TEXT("哦？混沌居然放他上來？"), TEXT("Oh? Hundun actually let him through?") },
{ TEXT("好安靜的小鬼。你不怕嗎？"), TEXT("Such a quiet brat. Aren't you scared?") },
{ TEXT("怕。可是孩子們說，你們……其實也很寂寞。"), TEXT("I am. But the children say that you... are actually lonely too.") },
{ TEXT("……寂寞？被壓在結界下幾千年，只剩下恨。"), TEXT("...Lonely? Thousands of years under the barrier leave nothing but hatred.") },
{ TEXT("那麼，等一切結束，請和燁先生一起，把話說清楚吧。"), TEXT("Then, when this is over, please talk it all through, together with Mr. Yoh.") },
{ TEXT("說話……我們沒有嘴，也沒有人聽。……好。若你贏了，我們就聽你說。"), TEXT("Talk... We have no mouths, and no one listens. ...Fine. If you win, we will listen to you.") },
{ TEXT("……輸了。正直的人，原來也能活下來啊。"), TEXT("...We lost. So honest people can survive after all.") },
{ TEXT("我會把你們封回去。可是不是用恨，是用約定！"), TEXT("I'll seal you back. But not with hatred. With a promise!") },
{ TEXT("約定？"), TEXT("A promise?") },
{ TEXT("下一次天門之夜，我會來看你們。不讓你們再被忘記！"), TEXT("Next Night of the Heaven's Gate, I'll come to see you. I won't let you be forgotten again!") },
{ TEXT("……那、那順便帶點吃的！"), TEXT("...Th-then bring some food too!") },
{ TEXT("……結界，重新亮起來了。守護者也快醒了。"), TEXT("...The barrier is shining again. The guardian will wake soon.") },
{ TEXT("……我退了。第一次。"), TEXT("...I retreated. For the first time.") },
{ TEXT("你沒有退。你只是輸了。"), TEXT("You didn't retreat. You just lost.") },
{ TEXT("……哼。這兩個不一樣嗎？"), TEXT("...Hmph. Is there a difference?") },
{ TEXT("不一樣。下次再來比。"), TEXT("There is. We'll have a rematch.") },
{ TEXT("哈！這射手原來會說笑話。"), TEXT("Ha! So the archer can tell a joke.") },
{ TEXT("結界重新合上了。我們回去睡吧……這一次，不是被壓著，是自己躺下。"), TEXT("The barrier has closed again. Let's go back to sleep... This time not pinned down, but lying down of our own accord.") },
{ TEXT("吃、吃不下了……我認輸……"), TEXT("I c-can't eat any more... I give up...") },
{ TEXT("好耶！那等燁醒了，大家一起吃飯喔！"), TEXT("Yay! Then when Yoh wakes up, we all eat together!") },
{ TEXT("被封印的傢伙要怎麼吃飯啦！"), TEXT("How are sealed beasts supposed to eat dinner?!") },
{ TEXT("天門之夜我來接你們！一年一次，請你們吃大餐！"), TEXT("I'll come get you on the Night of the Heaven's Gate! Once a year, a big feast on me!") },
{ TEXT("……真是奇怪的人類。"), TEXT("...What a strange human.") },
{ TEXT("呵……那就約好了。結界合上之前，讓我們記住這個味道。"), TEXT("Heh... Then it's a promise. Before the barrier closes, let us remember this taste.") },
{ TEXT("你的舞，跳得比我好。"), TEXT("You dance better than I do.") },
{ TEXT("是孩子們在跳。……現在，可以說話了嗎？"), TEXT("It's the children who danced. ...Can we talk now?") },
{ TEXT("……我們只是想被看見。"), TEXT("...We only wanted to be seen.") },
{ TEXT("還想吃飽一點。"), TEXT("And to eat our fill.") },
{ TEXT("還想有人聽我們吵架。"), TEXT("And for someone to listen to our quarrels.") },
{ TEXT("那麼，孩子們會記得你們。燁先生醒來後，也會聽的。"), TEXT("Then the children will remember you. And when Mr. Yoh wakes, he will listen too.") },
{ TEXT("……謝謝你，人偶師。結界合上了。我們……晚安。"), TEXT("...Thank you, puppeteer. The barrier has closed. We'll... say good night.") },
{ TEXT("凶獸逃向了天宮深處"), TEXT("The beast fled deeper into the Heavenly Palace") },
{ TEXT("四凶齊聚"), TEXT("The Four Perils Gather") },
